        "headline": "Dense Fog Advisory issued October 1 at 11:06PM AKDT until October 2 at 10:00AM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...Visibilities down to 1/4 mile in dense fog.\n\n* WHERE...Petersburg Borough.\n\n* WHEN...Until 10 AM AKDT Friday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Low visibility could make travel conditions hazardous.",
        "severity": "Moderate",
        "certainty": "Likely",
        "urgency": "Expected",
        "sender": "NWS Juneau AK",
